ormal system for Propositional Logic. Premises are denoted by 'From' and conclusions by 'Conclude'.\u003c/p\u003e","\u003chr\u003e","\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eConstants\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e","\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"lurch-atom\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-metadata_type=\"\u0026quot;expression\u0026quot;\" data-metadata_lurch-notation=\"\u0026quot;Declare ⇔, and, ⇒, or, ¬, contradiction\u0026quot;\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"lurch-atom-body\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ML__latex\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ML__base\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ML__text\"\u003eDeclare \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ML__cmr\"\u003e⇔\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ML__text\"\u003e, and, \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ML__cmr\"\u003e⇒\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ML__text\"\u003e, or, \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ML__ams\"\u003e¬\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ML__text\"\u003e, and \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ML__cmr\"\u003e→←\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e to be constants.\u003c/p\u003e","\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDefinitions\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e","\u003cdiv class=\"lurch-atom\" data-metadata_type=\"\u0026quot;rule\u0026quot;\" data-shell_title=\"Rule:\"\u003e","\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eand+\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"lurch-atom\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-metadata_type=\"\u0026quot;expression\u0026quot;\" data-metadata_lurch-notation=\"\u0026quot;From W\u0026quot;\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"lurch-atom-body\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ML__latex\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ML__base\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ML__text\"\u003eFrom \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ML__mathit\" style=\"margin-right: 0.14em;\"\u003eW\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan class=\"lurch-atom\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-metadata_type=\"\u0026quot;expression\u0026quot;\" data-metadata_lurch-notation=\"\u0026quot;From V\u0026quot;\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"lurch-atom-body\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ML__latex\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ML__base\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ML__text\"\u003eFrom \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ML__mathit\" style=\"margin-right: 0.23em;\"\u003eV\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003eConclude \u003cspan class=\"lurch-atom\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-metadata_type=\"\u0026quot;expression\u0026quot;\" data-metadata_lurch-notation=\"\u0026quot;W and V\u0026quot;\" data-metadata_latex=\"\u0026quot; W\\\\text{ and } V\u0026quot;\" data-metadata_given=\"false\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"lurch-atom-body\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ML__latex\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ML__base\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ML__mathit\" style=\"margin-right: 0.14em;\"\u003eW\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ML__text\"\u003e and \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ML__mathit\" style=\"margin-right: 0.23em;\"\u003eV\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","\u003c/div\u003e","\u003cdiv class=\"lurch-atom\" data-metadata_type=\"\u0026quot;rule\u0026quot;\" data-shell_title=\"Rule:\"\u003e","\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eand-\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"lurch-atom\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-metadata_type=\"\u0026quot;expression\u0026quot;\" data-metadata_lurch-notation=\"\u0026quot;From W and V\u0026quot;\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"lurch-atom-body\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ML__latex\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ML__base\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ML__text\"\u003eFrom \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ML__mathit\" style=\"margin-right: 0.14em;\"\u003eW\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ML__text\"\u003e and \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ML__mathit\" style=\"margin-right: 0.23em;\"\u003eV\u003c/span\u003e\u00