<div id="LC135" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;not+ (proof by contradiction)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</div>
<div id="LC136" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;p&gt;From the subproof:&lt;/p&gt;</div>
