<div id="LC471" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">            &lt;div id=&quot;document&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Sequences and Recursion&lt;/h1&gt;</div>
<div id="LC472" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;p&gt;Once we have defined the natural numbers we can use them to define sequences, both finite and infinite. They can be defined explicitly or recursively.&amp;nbsp; In this topic we define a few well known recursive sequences.&amp;nbsp; All of the rules, definitions, and theorems in the Number Theory Theorems topic are also available here.&lt;/p&gt;</div>
<div id="LC473" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;hr&gt;</div>
<div id="LC474" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;h3&gt;Constants&lt;/h3&gt;</div>
<div id="LC475" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot; data-metadata_type=&quot;&amp;quot;expression&amp;quot;&quot; data-metadata_lurch-notation=&quot;&amp;quot;Declare Sum, Fib, !, multinomial, choose, ^&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom-body&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__latex&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__base&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__text&quot;&gt;Declare Sum, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot; style=&quot;margin-right: 0.14em;&quot;&gt;F&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__text&quot;&gt;, factorial, multinomial, choose,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__cmr&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__msubsup&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__vlist-t&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__vlist-r&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__vlist&quot; style=&quot;height: 0.81em;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;top: -3.41em; margin-right: 0.05em;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;height: 0.39em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__cmr&quot;&gt;∧&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; to be constants.&lt;/p&gt;</div>
<div id="LC476" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;h3&gt;Definitions&lt;/h3&gt;</div>
<div id="LC477" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</div>
<div id="LC478" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div class=&quot;lurch-atom&quot; data-metadata_type=&quot;&amp;quot;rule&amp;quot;&quot; data-shell_title=&quot;Rule:&quot;&gt;</div>
<div id="LC479" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot; data-metadata_type=&quot;&amp;quot;expression&amp;quot;&quot; data-metadata_lurch-notation=&quot;&amp;quot;sum k to 0 of @P(k) = @P(0)&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom-body&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__latex&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__base&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__op-group&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__vlist-r&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__vlist&quot; style=&quot;height: 1.81em;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__center&quot; style=&quot;top: -1.84em;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;height: 0.49em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot; style=&quot;margin-right: 0.04em;&quot;&gt;k&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__cmr&quot;&gt;=0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__center&quot; style=&quot;top: -3.05em;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__op-symbol ML__large-op&quot;&gt;∑&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__center&quot; style=&quot;top: -4.3em;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;height: 0.46em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__cmr&quot;&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__vlist-s&quot;&gt;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__cal&quot; style=&quot;margin-right: 0.09em;&quot;&gt;P&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__left-right&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 0em; height: 0.69444em;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__small-delim ML__open&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot; style=&quot;margin-right: 0.04em;&quot;&gt;k&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__small-delim ML__close&q