<div id="LC484" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Natural Number Exponentiation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</div>
<div id="LC485" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;</div>
