<div id="LC714" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot; data-metadata_type=&quot;&amp;quot;expression&amp;quot;&quot; data-metadata_lurch-notation=&quot;&amp;quot;z=⟨a,b,c⟩ and (a in A and (b in B and c in C)) for some a,b,c&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom-body&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__latex&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__base&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot; style=&quot;margin-right: 0.05em;&quot;&gt;z&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__cmr&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__left-right&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.8888799999999999em;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__small-delim ML__open&quot;&gt;⟨&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__cmr&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot;&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__cmr&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot;&gt;c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__small-delim ML__close&quot;&gt;⟩&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__text&quot;&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__left-right&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: -0.25em; height: 1em;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__small-delim ML__open&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__cmr&quot;&gt;∈&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__text&quot;&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__left-right&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: -0.0391em; height: 0.73354em;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__small-delim ML__open&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot;&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__cmr&quot;&gt;∈&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot; style=&quot;margin-right: 0.06em;&quot;&gt;B&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__text&quot;&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot;&gt;c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__cmr&quot;&gt;∈&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot; style=&quot;margin-right: 0.08em;&quot;&gt;C&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__small-delim ML__close&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__small-delim ML__close&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__text&quot;&gt; for some &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__text&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot;&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__text&quot;&gt;, and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot;&gt;c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</div>
<div id="LC715" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC716" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC717" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC718" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">        &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lurch-atom-body&quot;&gt;&lt;table&gt;&lt;colgroup&gt;&lt;col&gt;&lt;col&gt;&lt;/colgroup&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Imported dependency document&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;Description:&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;tt&gt;none&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;Source:&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;tt&gt;math/Sets-Rules.lurch&lt;/tt&gt; (web)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;Auto-refresh:&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;yes&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-category=&quot;settings&quot; data-key=&quot;shell style&quot; data-value-type=&quot;json&quot;&gt;&quot;minimal&quot;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC719" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">            &lt;div id=&quot;document&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC720" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC721" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;h1&gt;Relations&lt;/h1&gt;</div>
<div id="LC722" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;p&gt;We now define a formal system for defining elementary concepts for relations.&amp;nbsp; This library includes all of the rules, definitions, and axioms from the Functions library.&lt;/p&gt;</div>
<div id="LC723" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC724" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;h3&gt;Constants&lt;/h3&gt;</div>
<div id="LC725" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot; data-metadata_type=&quot;&amp;quot;expression&amp;quot;&quot; data-metadata_lurch-notation=&quot;&amp;quot;Declare ~, reflexive, symmetric, transitive, irreflexive, antisymmetric&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom-body&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__latex&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__base&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__text&quot;&gt;Declare &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__cmr&quot;&gt;∼&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__text&quot;&gt;, reflexive, symmetric, transitive, irreflexive, and antisymmetric&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot; data-metadata_type=&quot;&amp;quot;expression&amp;quot;&quot; data-metadata_lurch-notation=&quot;&amp;quot;declare total, class, partial order, strict partial order, total order&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom-body&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__latex&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__base&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__text&quot;&gt;declare total, class, partial order, strict partial order, and total order&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, and&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot; data-metadata_type=&quot;&amp;quot;expression&amp;quot;&quot; data-metadata_lurch-notation=&quot;&amp;quot;declare equivalence relation, partition&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom-body&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__latex&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__base&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__text&quot;&gt;declare equivalence relation and partition&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; to be constants.&lt;/p&gt;</div>
<div id="LC726" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;p&gt;Note: you can use `~` as relation in infix notation e.g. by typing&lt;code&gt;x~y&lt;/code&gt; or in prefix notation if you surround it with single quotes, e.g. &lt;code&gt;&#39;~&#39;(x,y)&lt;/code&gt; means the same thing.&amp;nbsp; You can also refer to &lt;code&gt;&#39;~&#39;&lt;/code&gt; as a set of ordered pairs by enclosing it in single quotes as illustrated by the first definition below.&amp;nbsp; You can talk about properties of the relation tilde by enclosing it with single quotes as well, e.g. &lt;code&gt;&#39;~&#39; is reflexive.&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</div>
<div id="LC727" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;h3&gt;Definitions&lt;/h3&gt;</div>
<div id="LC728" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div class=&quot;lurch-atom&quot; data-metadata_type=&quot;&amp;quot;rule&amp;quot;&quot; data-shell_title=&quot;Rule:&quot;&gt;</div>
<div id="LC729" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relations as a set of pairs:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot; data-metadata_type=&quot;&amp;quot;expression&amp;quot;&quot; data-metadata_lurch-notation=&quot;&amp;quot;x~y&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom-body&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__latex&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__base&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__cmr&quot;&gt;∼&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot; style=&quot;margin-right: 0.04em;&quot;&gt;y&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot; data-metadata_type=&quot;&amp;quot;expression&amp;quot;&quot; data-metadata_lurch-notation=&quot;&amp;quot;equiv&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom-body&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__latex&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__base&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__cmr&quot;&gt;≡&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot; data-metadata_type=&quot;&amp;quot;expression&amp;quot;&quot; data-metadata_lurch-notation=&quot;&amp;quot;⟨x,y⟩ in &#39;~&#39;&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom-body&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__latex&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__base&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__left-right&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.625em;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__small-delim ML__open&quot;&gt;⟨&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__cmr&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot; style=&quot;margin-right: 0.04em;&quot;&gt;y&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__small-delim ML__close&quot;&gt;⟩&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__cmr&quot;&gt;∈∼&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</div>
<div id="LC730" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC731" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC732" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC733" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div class=&quot;lurch-atom&quot; data-metadata_type=&quot;&amp;quot;rule&amp;quot;&quot; data-shell_title=&quot;Rule:&quot;&gt;</div>
<div id="LC734" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reflexive:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot; data-metadata_type=&quot;&amp;quot;expression&amp;quot;&quot; data-metadata_lurch-notation=&quot;&amp;quot;if &#39;~&#39; is reflexive&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom-body&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__latex&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__base&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__text&quot;&gt;if &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__cmr&quot;&gt;∼&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__text&quot;&gt; is reflexive&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; then &lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot; data-metadata_type=&quot;&amp;quot;expression&amp;quot;&quot; data-metadata_lurch-notation=&quot;&amp;quot;x~x&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom-body&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__latex&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__base&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__cmr&quot;&gt;∼&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</div>
<div id="LC735" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC736" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div class=&quot;lurch-atom&quot; data-metadata_type=&quot;&amp;quot;rule&amp;quot;&quot; data-shell_title=&quot;Rule:&quot;&gt;</div>
<div id="LC737" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reflexive:&lt;/strong&gt; From the subproof&lt;/p&gt;</div>
<div id="LC738" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div class=&quot;lurch-atom&quot; data-metadata_type=&quot;&amp;quot;subproof&amp;quot;&quot; data-shell_title=&quot;&quot;&gt;</div>
<div id="LC739" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot; data-metadata_type=&quot;&amp;quot;expression&amp;quot;&quot; data-metadata_lurch-notation=&quot;&amp;quot;Let x&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom-body&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__latex&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__base&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__text&quot;&gt;Let &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; be arbitrary&lt;/p&gt;</div>
<div id="LC740" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot; data-metadata_type=&quot;&amp;quot;expression&amp;quot;&quot; data-metadata_lurch-notation=&quot;&amp;quot;x~x&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom-body&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__latex&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__base&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__cmr&quot;&gt;∼&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</div>
<div id="LC741" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC742" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;p&gt;we can conclude&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot; data-metadata_type=&quot;&amp;quot;expression&amp;quot;&quot; data-metadata_lurch-notation=&quot;&amp;quot;&#39;~&#39; is reflexive&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom-body&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__latex&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__base&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__cmr&quot;&gt;∼&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__text&quot;&gt; is reflexive&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</div>
<div id="LC743" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC744" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div class=&quot;lurch-atom&quot; data-metadata_type=&quot;&amp;quot;rule&amp;quot;&quot; data-shell_title=&quot;Rule:&quot;&gt;</div>
<div id="LC745" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Symmetric:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot; data-metadata_type=&quot;&amp;quot;expression&amp;quot;&quot; data-metadata_lurch-notation=&quot;&amp;quot;If &#39;~&#39; is symmetric, x~y&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom-body&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__latex&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__base&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__text&quot;&gt;If &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__cmr&quot;&gt;∼&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__text&quot;&gt; is symmetric and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__cmr&quot;&gt;∼&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot; style=&quot;margin-right: 0.04em;&quot;&gt;y&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; then &lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot; data-metadata_type=&quot;&amp;quot;expression&amp;quot;&quot; data-metadata_lurch-notation=&quot;&amp;quot;y~x&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom-body&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__latex&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__base&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot; style=&quot;margin-right: 0.04em;&quot;&gt;y&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__cmr&quot;&gt;∼&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</div>
<div id="LC746" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC747" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div class=&quot;lurch-atom&quot; data-metadata_type=&quot;&amp;quot;rule&amp;quot;&quot; data-shell_title=&quot;Rule:&quot;&gt;</div>
<div id="LC748" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Symmetric:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</div>
<div id="LC749" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div class=&quot;lurch-atom&quot; data-metadata_type=&quot;&amp;quot;rule&amp;quot;&quot; data-shell_title=&quot;Rule:&quot;&gt;</div>
<div id="LC750" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;p&gt;From the subproof&lt;/p&gt;</div>
<div id="LC751" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div class=&quot;lurch-atom&quot; data-metadata_type=&quot;&amp;quot;subproof&amp;quot;&quot; data-shell_title=&quot;&quot;&gt;</div>
<div id="LC752" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot; data-metadata_type=&quot;&amp;quot;expression&amp;quot;&quot; data-metadata_lurch-notation=&quot;&amp;quot;Let x,y be such that x~y&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom-body&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__latex&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__base&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__text&quot;&gt;Let &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__text&quot;&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot; style=&quot;margin-right: 0.04em;&quot;&gt;y&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__text&quot;&gt; be such that &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__cmr&quot;&gt;∼&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot; style=&quot;margin-right: 0.04em;&quot;&gt;y&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</div>
<div id="LC753" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot; data-metadata_type=&quot;&amp;quot;expression&amp;quot;&quot; data-metadata_lurch-notation=&quot;&amp;quot;y~x&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom-body&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__latex&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__base&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot; style=&quot;margin-right: 0.04em;&quot;&gt;y&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__cmr&quot;&gt;∼&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</div>
<div id="LC754" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC755" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;p&gt;we can conclude&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot; data-metadata_type=&quot;&amp;quot;expression&amp;quot;&quot; data-metadata_lurch-notation=&quot;&amp;quot;&#39;~&#39; is symmetric&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom-body&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__latex&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__base&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__cmr&quot;&gt;∼&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__text&quot;&gt; is symmetric&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</div>
<div id="LC756" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC757" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC758" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div class=&quot;lurch-atom&quot; data-metadata_type=&quot;&amp;quot;rule&amp;quot;&quot; data-shell_title=&quot;Rule:&quot;&gt;</div>
<div id="LC759" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transitive:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot; data-metadata_type=&quot;&amp;quot;expression&amp;quot;&quot; data-metadata_lurch-notation=&quot;&amp;quot;If &#39;~&#39; is transitive, x~y, y~z&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom-body&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__latex&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__base&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__text&quot;&gt;If &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__cmr&quot;&gt;∼&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__text&quot;&gt; is transitive, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__cmr&quot;&gt;∼&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot; style=&quot;margin-right: 0.04em;&quot;&gt;y&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__text&quot;&gt;, and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot; style=&quot;margin-right: 0.04em;&quot;&gt;y&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__cmr&quot;&gt;∼&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot; style=&quot;margin-right: 0.05em;&quot;&gt;z&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; then &lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot; data-metadata_type=&quot;&amp;quot;expression&amp;quot;&quot; data-metadata_lurch-notation=&quot;&amp;quot;x~z&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom-body&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__latex&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__base&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__cmr&quot;&gt;∼&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot; style=&quot;margin-right: 0.05em;&quot;&gt;z&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</div>
<div id="LC760" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC761" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div class=&quot;lurch-atom&quot; data-metadata_type=&quot;&amp;quot;rule&amp;quot;&quot; data-shell_title=&quot;Rule:&quot;&gt;</div>
<div id="LC762" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transitive:&lt;/strong&gt; From the subproof&lt;/p&gt;</div>
<div id="LC763" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div class=&quot;lurch-atom&quot; data-metadata_type=&quot;&amp;quot;subproof&amp;quot;&quot; data-shell_title=&quot;&quot;&gt;</div>
<div id="LC764" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot; data-metadata_type=&quot;&amp;quot;expression&amp;quot;&quot; data-metadata_lurch-notation=&quot;&amp;quot;Let x,y,z be such that x~y and y~z&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom-body&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__latex&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__base&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__text&quot;&gt;Let &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__text&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot; style=&quot;margin-right: 0.04em;&quot;&gt;y&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__text&quot;&gt;, and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot; style=&quot;margin-right: 0.05em;&quot;&gt;z&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__text&quot;&gt; be such that &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__cmr&quot;&gt;∼&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot; style=&quot;margin-right: 0.04em;&quot;&gt;y&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__text&quot;&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot; style=&quot;margin-right: 0.04em;&quot;&gt;y&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__cmr&quot;&gt;∼&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot; style=&quot;margin-right: 0.05em;&quot;&gt;z&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</div>
<div id="LC765" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot; data-metadata_type=&quot;&amp;quot;expression&amp;quot;&quot; data-metadata_lurch-notation=&quot;&amp;quot;x~z&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom-body&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__latex&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__base&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__cmr&quot;&gt;∼&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__mathit&quot; style=&quot;margin-right: 0.05em;&quot;&gt;z&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</div>
<div id="LC766" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC767" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;p&gt;we can conclude&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot; data-metadata_type=&quot;&amp;quot;expression&amp;quot;&quot; data-metadata_lurch-notation=&quot;&amp;quot;&#39;~&#39; is symmetric&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;lurch-atom-body&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__latex&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__base&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__cmr&quot;&gt;∼&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ML__text&quot;&gt; is symmetric&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</div>
<div id="LC768" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC769" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC770" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC771" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;:{ :&#39;~&#39; is reflexive x~x } // reflexive&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC772" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;:{ :{ Let x x~x } &#39;~&#39; is reflexive } // reflexive&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC773" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;:{ :&#39;~&#39; is symmetric :x~y y~x } // symmetric&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC774" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;:{ :{ Let x,y such that x~y y~x } &#39;~&#39; is symmetric } // symmetric&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC775" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;:{ :&#39;~&#39; is transitive :x~y :y~z x~z } // transitive&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC776" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;:{ :{ Let x,y,z such that x~y and y~z x~z } &#39;~&#39; is transitive } // transitive&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC777" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;br&gt;</div>
<div id="LC778" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;// equivalence relation&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC779" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;:{ &#39;~&#39; is an equivalence relation ≡&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC780" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;&#39;~&#39; is reflexive &#39;~&#39; is symmetric &#39;~&#39; is transitive }&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC781" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;:{ x∈[a] ≡ x~a } // equivalence class&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC782" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;br&gt;</div>
<div id="LC783" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;// congruence mod m&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC784" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;:{ a ≈ b mod m ≡ m | a-b }&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC785" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC786" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;// partition TODO: after doing indexed union&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC787" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;// :{ :P is a partition of A P⊆𝒫(A) ∪P=A {:s∈A :t∈A s∩t=Set() or s=t } }&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC788" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;br&gt;</div>
<div id="LC789" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;// order&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC790" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;:{ :&#39;~&#39; is irreflexive ¬ x~x } // irreflexive&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC791" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;:{ :{ Let x ¬ x~x } &#39;~&#39; is irreflexive } // irreflexive&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC792" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;:{ :&#39;~&#39; is antisymmetric :x~y :y~x x=y } // antisymmetric&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC793" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;:{ :{ Let x,y such that x~y and y~x x=y } &#39;~&#39; is antisymmetric } // antisymmetric&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC794" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;:{ :&#39;~&#39; is total x~y or y~x } // total&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC795" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;:{ :{ Let x,y x~y or y~x } &#39;~&#39; is total } // total&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC796" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC797" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;:{ &#39;~&#39; is a partial order ≡ // partial order&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC798" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;&#39;~&#39; is reflexive&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC799" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;&#39;~&#39; is antisymmetric&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC800" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;&#39;~&#39; is transitive }&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC801" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;:{ &#39;~&#39; is a strict partial order ≡ // strict partial order&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC802" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;&#39;~&#39; is irreflexive&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC803" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;&#39;~&#39; is antisymmetric&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC804" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;&#39;~&#39; is transitive }&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC805" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;:{ &#39;~&#39; is a total order ≡ // total order&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC806" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;&#39;~&#39; is antisymmetric&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC807" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;&#39;~&#39; is transitive&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC808" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;&#39;~&#39; is total }&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC809" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;br&gt;</div>
<div id="LC810" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;div&gt;}&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC811" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC812" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">        &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lurch-atom-body&quot;&gt;&lt;table&gt;&lt;colgroup&gt;&lt;col&gt;&lt;col&gt;&lt;/colgroup&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Imported dependency document&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;Description:&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;tt&gt;none&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;Source:&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;tt&gt;math/Relations-Rules.lurch&lt;/tt&gt; (web)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;Auto-refresh:&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;yes&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</div>
<div id="LC813" class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents-no-virtualization react-file-line html-div ">            &lt;div id=&quot;document&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</div>
